LSTM Networks`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:96.8,desc:`Learns individual customer transaction histories to identify out-of-pattern spending spikes.`},{id:3,name:`Geolocation Anomaly Detection`,category:`Context`,model:`Distance-based Isolation Forests`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:97.2,desc:`Detects impossible travel speeds and suspicious cross-border geolocation hops.`},{id:4,name:`Device Fingerprint Intelligence`,category:`Device`,model:`DBSCAN Clustering & Graph Nodes`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:95.5,desc:`Analyzes hardware characteristics, identifiers, and browser agents to identify emulator spoofing.`},{id:5,name:`Explainable AI (XAI)`,category:`Interpretability`,model:`SHAP (Additive Explanations)`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:100,desc:`Explains every mathematical risk score using feature attribution waterfall charts.`},{id:6,name:`Fraud Ring GNN Analysis`,category:`Network`,model:`Graph Neural Networks (GraphSAGE)`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:94.2,desc:`Maps relationships between accounts, identifying circular loops and mule account structures.`},{id:7,name:`Transaction Sequence Intelligence`,category:`Sequence`,model:`LSTM & Multi-Head Attention`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:97.5,desc:`Evaluates transaction chains over time to detect fast automated cash-outs.`},{id:8,name:`Smart Alert Prioritization`,category:`Operations`,model:`Ranking Algorithms`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:93.8,desc:`Triage-ranks security alerts automatically based on risk level and potential loss.`},{id:9,name:`Adaptive Learning Engine`,category:`Self-Improvement`,model:`Reinforcement Learning from Feedback`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:95,desc:`Retrains weights dynamically based on analyst action feedback (Confirm/Dismiss).`},{id:10,name:`AI-Based Threshold Optimization`,category:`Optimization`,model:`Bayesian Optimization`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:92.4,desc:`Automatically adjusts decision boundaries to optimize precision/recall trade-offs.`},{id:11,name:`Fraud Heatmap Analytics`,category:`Context`,model:`Spatial Density Clustering`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:94.7,desc:`Identifies geographical hot spots with elevated fraud rates in real-time.`},{id:12,name:`Insider Threat Detection`,category:`Internal`,model:`Behavioral Outlier Detection`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:96.1,desc:`Monitors internal bank administrator database accesses for anomalous patterns.`},{id:13,name:`Synthetic Identity Classifier`,category:`Identity`,model:`KYC Graph Matching`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:97.9,desc:`Flags synthetic bank identities generated from combinations of fake/stolen credentials.`},{id:14,name:`AI Investigator Assistant (NLP)`,category:`Operations`,model:`Transformer LLM Summarizer`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:98.2,desc:`Summarizes flagged transaction risks into natural language recommendations.`},{id:15,name:`Fraud Attack Simulation Engine`,category:`Simulation`,model:`Generative Adversarial Networks (GAN)`,status:`STANDBY`,accuracy:91,desc:`Generates fake adversarial transaction profiles to stress-test existing classifiers.`},{id:16,name:`Drift Detection Intelligence`,category:`Interpretability`,model:`Kolmogorov-Smirnov Drift Test`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:99.1,desc:`Monitors input distributions for feature drift and model performance decay.`},{id:17,name:`AI Risk Categorization Classifier`,category:`Interpretability`,model:`Multi-Class Logistic Classifier`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:95.8,desc:`Categorizes flagged alerts into Account Takeover, Payment Fraud, or Insider Fraud.`},{id:18,name:`Predictive Fraud Timeline`,category:`Time-Series`,model:`Prophet Time-Series Forecasting`,status:`ACTIVE`,accuracy:91.8,desc:`Predicts fraud volume and attack patterns for the next 7 days.`},{id:19,name:`Federated Learning Gateway`,category:`Security`,model:`Privacy-Preserving Local Training`,status:`STANDBY`,accuracy:89.5,desc:`Allows collaborative training across bank branches without sharing customer PII.`},{id:20,name:`Biometric Integrity Verification`,category:`Security`,model:`Touch/Face Biometric Matc